# Optional: a private Unichain Sepolia RPC URL (your own node / provider).
# Without this the app falls back to the public endpoint (https://sepolia.unichain.org),
# which is rate-limited and caps getLogs at a small block range.
NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.unichain.org

# Optional: a dedicated Arc testnet RPC URL (Alchemy, QuickNode, dRPC). Used for
# every Arc read except eth_getLogs, which always goes to the public endpoints:
# Alchemy's free tier caps eth_getLogs at a 10-block range, far below what the
# activity feed scans. Without this, all Arc traffic uses the public endpoints,
# which rate-limit under load. It ships to the browser, so restrict the key to
# your domains in the provider's dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ARC_RPC_URL=
